{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"organizationLevel"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"role":"symbol","title":"organizationLevel","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A4UserV17organizationLevelSbvp"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/organizationLevel"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether this is an "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"organization-level"}]},{"type":"text","text":" principal (CONTRACT.md §5.2)."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/organizationlevel"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"organizationLevel"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Such a principal’s record lives in its organization’s reserved tenant, so its global","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"grants apply in every tenant of that organization, and it can act on a different one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by sending a different ","type":"text"},{"code":"X-Axiam-Tenant","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the next request — no re-login, because it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already is a principal of every tenant there.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An ordinary tenant principal is a principal of exactly one tenant; the same header"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change produces a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"403"},{"type":"text","text":" for it. This flag is therefore what an application checks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" offering a tenant switch, rather than discovering the answer from a failed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Derived, never asserted"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§5.2 rule 2): resolved server-side from the caller’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tenant record, and never sent by this SDK. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" when the login response omits it —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is what a server older than contract 1.31 answers — and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" on the guard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path, where this value is built from token claims that do not carry it. Both are the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"safe direction: the application then offers no cross-tenant action."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Since contract 1.35 that reach can be narrowed per assignment, so this flag alone no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"longer decides what to offer: consult "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/reachableTenantIDs"},{"type":"text","text":" as well (§5.2.3 rule 3)."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser/reachableTenantIDs":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tenants this caller’s roles reach, when they are narrowed (§5.2.3)."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/reachabletenantids","title":"reachableTenantIDs","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/reachableTenantIDs","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reachableTenantIDs","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxiamUser","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser","title":"AxiamUser","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An authenticated AXIAM identity."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxiamUser","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","title":"AxiamSDK","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser/organizationLevel":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/organizationlevel","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether this is an "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"organization-level"}]},{"type":"text","text":" principal (CONTRACT.md §5.2)."}],"title":"organizationLevel","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"organizationLevel","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/organizationLevel","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}